# NOTE (ETK fork): upstream ignores app/build.gradle so each builder fills in
# their own signing info. This fork TRACKS it — the release buildType signs with
# signingConfigs.debug, so the file holds no keystore path and no password. It
# has to be tracked: it carries ndkVersion and the LLVM job throttles, and a
# clean clone cannot build without it (that is why the CI lane never worked).
# Keep it out of any upstream PR.

